            <div xml:id="d39">

                <pb facs="0149" n="91" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg91"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Romero to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Legation in the United States
                                of America, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington,</hi></hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-02-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 24, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary:</hi> In a note which I addressed from
                    New York to your department on the 6th of Novemher, 1865, I mentioned that I had
                    sent your note of the 3d of that month, relating to duties collected from
                    American citizens by General Alvarez in Acapulco, to my government. I now send
                    you a communication from Mr. Lerdo de Tejada, minister of foreign affairs of the
                    Mexican republic, dated at El Paso del Norte, the 22d of January, and numbered
                    22, in which I am informed that your note had been sent to the Secretary of the
                    Treasury for his decision, as the affair belongs to that branch of the
                    government.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of the occasion to express to you, Mr. Secretary, the assurances
                    of my most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M. ROMERO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Seward, <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi></hi>.</p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d39-a1.xml" xpointer="d39-a1"/>
